+ * it just made. Here the creator waits until the new thread is seen inside a
+ * blocking lv2 call, or has finished, bounded so that a thread which blocks
+ * some way this cannot see (inside an HLE import, or never) costs a pause and
+ * not a hang. It does not model preemption after creation. */
